OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA quite cloudy start in the
OL,6,Fsoutheast with some light rain
OL,7,Fpossible. Otherwise bright or sunny
OL,8,Fspells developing through the day.
OL,9,FMostly dry but the chance of a few
OL,10,Fshowers developing. Becoming quite
OL,11,Fbreezy around the Antrim coast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FDry in the evening with some
OL,14,Fsunny then clear spells, turning
OL,15,Fcloudier over the north. Outbreaks of
OL,16,Frain spread east over southern
OL,17,Fcounties through the early hours.
OL,18,FWinds falling light.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
