OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FCloudy with outbreaks of
OL,6,Frain spreading to all parts in the
OL,7,Fmorning. Turning drier in the
OL,8,Fafternoon with bright or sunny spells
OL,9,Fdeveloping but also a few sharp
OL,10,Fshowers.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FRain or
OL,13,Fshowers at times, perhaps heavy and
OL,14,Fthundery, but also occasional drier
OL,15,Fand brighter spells. Light or moderate
OL,16,Fwinds, likely freshening on Monday and
OL,17,FTuesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
